WEBVTT

00:05:29.557 --> 00:05:34.711
Sometimes, people think
I'm a performer or a drag queen.

00:05:35.704 --> 00:05:37.125
I'm not.

00:05:37.149 --> 00:05:40.725
Although my life appears
to be a performance,

00:05:40.749 --> 00:05:42.125
it's not.

00:05:42.149 --> 00:05:43.844
It's very real.

00:05:44.791 --> 00:05:47.832
People respond to me as they would
any other type of artwork.

00:05:48.272 --> 00:05:51.164
Many people are fascinated and engaged.

00:05:51.536 --> 00:05:54.574
Some people walk around me,
staring, shy at first.

00:05:55.024 --> 00:05:59.446
Then they come up to me and they say
they love or absolutely hate what I do.